    "# \ufe0f Glu-Stock: 02_STRATEGIC_AUDIT\n",
    "**Phase**: Strategic Intelligence (The Auditor) | v18.25 (Consolidated)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook uses a Large Language Model (Gemma-7B) to perform a final strategic audit on quantitative signals with VETO power."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
